  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="8.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Duns">Duns</ref> 8.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hit man begeondan str[e]ame agnian wylle, ðone sceal þæt beon mid ordale.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If the man on the other side of the stream [he who seized the cattle] wants to retain them, then that shall be [only possible] through the ordeal.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Si quis trans flumen propriare sibi uelit, tunc erit hoc per ordalium.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
